  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Language training &amp; Professional training JPO/BBE /NE/JPED - Language training &amp; Profession</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Spr&#xE5;kutbildning&amp;Fackutbildning JPO/SARC/BBE/NE/JPD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;rberedelseutbildning f&#xF6;r deltagare och deras medf&#xF6;ljare inom programmen JPO, SARC, JED, BBE, YK,. Inkluderar spr&#xE5;kutbildning. Syftet med f&#xF6;reberedelseutbildningen &#xE4;r att medverka till att en h&#xF6;gre andel av programdeltagarna forts&#xE4;tter att arbeta inom  internationellt utvecklingssamarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation training for participants (and spouses) within JPO, SARC, JED, BBE, YK, . Includes language training.  The purpose of the preparatory training is to contribute to a higher proportion of program participants continue to work in international development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
